{%- comment -%}
  Summer scene for sections/seasonal-collection: sunglasses sun with turning
  rays, heat shimmer, sea, sand, palm and the penguin. Decorative only — the
  section hides it from assistive tech. Every animated node is its own box
  (no animation inside an SVG) so the compositor can run it.
  Params: badge, caption, show_badge, mascot (name, blank = none).
  part: 'icon' → only the small sun glyph used in the eyebrow.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if part == 'icon' -%}
<svg class="seasonal__glyph" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.2"/><path d="M12 2.5v2.2M12 19.3v2.2M2.5 12h2.2M19.3 12h2.2M5.3 5.3l1.6 1.6M17.1 17.1l1.6 1.6M5.3 18.7l1.6-1.6M17.1 6.9l1.6-1.6"/></svg>
{%- else -%}
<div class="sa__sunbox">
